  <li> Kickbacks from book sellers - If your order from Amazon.com,
       Barnes and Noble, or ComputerLiteracy  by
       following the link in the ordering section, I get free
       beer.<br><br>
  <li> Errata entries now reflect source code changes. <br><br> 
  <li> Added ``for educators'' section.<br><br>
</ol>

