email address.  Added best online price information.  Added prebuilt C
distribution for Linux and Solaris.  Java jar file now contains
*.class files for people without Java compilers. <br><br>

<li> <i>9 Sep 1998</i> - Fixed minor typos. <br><br>

<li> <i>27 Aug 1998</i> - Corrected affiliation and web links for
